BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tracka-12-prepare@patent-to-pilot.github
DTSTAMP:20261128T182000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Bangkok:20271120T090000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Bangkok:20271120T093000
SUMMARY:Track A 12-month readout (prepare)
DESCRIPTION:Confirm the release and Worker settings. The scorer stays PENDI
 NG until maturity UTC.\nReplace VERSION_ID and OSF_UPDATE_4_FREEZE_SHA256
  with the published values.\npython -m loe_bench.score_release --release 1
 0.5281/zenodo.VERSION_ID --horizon 12 --out track-a-results --freeze-sha25
 6 OSF_UPDATE_4_FREEZE_SHA256\nGuide: https://github.com/siriponsri/patent-
 to-pilot/blob/main/docs/loe-bench/HOW-TO-SCORE-TRACK-A.md\nOSF registratio
 n: https://doi.org/10.17605/OSF.IO/P2SMD\nZenodo version DOI: https://doi.
 org/10.5281/zenodo.VERSION_ID (placeholder)
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:PT0S
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Track A readout reminder
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
